date,time,currency,impact
# Copy to  <data>\MQL5\Files\the5ers_red_news.csv  and fill in the events you
# want the news gate to block, ONE per row, oldest first.
#
#   date      YYYY.MM.DD          (default frame: UTC - see below)
#   time      HH:MM              (24h)
#
# TIMES: this template is UTC (the delivered convention).  A file produced by
# MQL5_Master\Scripts\ExportRedNews.mq5 carries its own frame marker as the
# first line -  #timezone=server,,,  - because the MT5 calendar speaks server
# time.  Do not copy that marker into a UTC file, and do not mix the two.
#   currency  USD / EUR / GBP / ALL ...   matched against the EA's symbol list,
#             so USD blocks EURUSD, USDJPY, XAUUSD...; ALL blocks every symbol
#   impact    HIGH               (or a number >= 2; anything else is ignored)
#
# Each row blocks a window around the event (the engines ship 30 min before /
# 30 min after) and the red-folder engines flatten 15 minutes before it.
#
# Easier: run MQL5_Master\Scripts\ExportRedNews.mq5 once - it writes this file
# from the terminal's own economic calendar, already in this format.
#
# Rows starting with '#' are skipped by the engine (no parsable timestamp).
# Examples (remove the leading '#' to use):
# 2026.10.02,12:30,USD,HIGH
# 2026.10.02,12:15,EUR,HIGH
